NAME
    edit - the built-in text editor

SYNOPSIS
    edit <file>

DESCRIPTION
    edit opens <file> in an editor tab (creating it if it doesn't exist). It has
    undo, find / find-replace, a clipboard, and Lua syntax coloring. Under the
    panels TUI it runs as a tab you can switch away from with Ctrl+T.

KEYS
    Ctrl+S   Save              Ctrl+Q   Close tab
    Ctrl+F   Find              Ctrl+H   Find / replace
    Ctrl+Z   Undo              Ctrl+G   Go to line
    Ctrl+C   Copy line         Ctrl+X   Cut line        Ctrl+V   Paste

EXAMPLES
    edit /home/me/notes.txt
    edit /etc/tos.cfg          (admin: a system config file)

SEE ALSO
    man filesystem, run, MANUAL.md (Section 4.3)
